! Diagnostic export for the already solved structural benchmark.
! Open the matching STR_2D.db and STR_2D.rst before calling this macro.
! No SOLVE, SAVE, geometry, material, constraint or load edits are performed.
! Postprocessing state is set to LAST, FULL graphics, global axes, AVPRIN=0.
! Outputs overwrite only TFBM_*.txt files in the working directory (.\output with RUN.dat).
FINISH
/POST1
FILE,STR_2D,rst
SET,LAST
/GRAPHICS,FULL
/EFACET,2
CSYS,0
RSYS,0
DSYS,0
AVPRIN,0
ALLSEL,ALL

/OUTPUT,TFBM_model,txt
/COM,TF benchmark export: loaded database must match STR_2D.rst.
/COM,Global Cartesian axes; AVPRIN=0; selected result is SET,LAST.
SET,LIST
GSLIST,ALL
ETLIST,ALL
MPLIST,ALL
RLIST,ALL
CSLIST,ALL
DLIST,ALL
CELIST,ALL
CPLIST,ALL
BFLIST,ALL
*STATUS
/OUTPUT

/OUTPUT,TFBM_global,txt
/COM,Coordinates, connectivity, applied nodal loads, displacements, reactions.
ALLSEL,ALL
NLIST,ALL
ELIST,ALL
FLIST,ALL
PRNSOL,U,COMP
PRRSOL,F
GSLIST,ALL
/OUTPUT

/OUTPUT,TFBM_jacket,txt
/COM,Material 2 only. Nodal averaging is restricted to this material.
ALLSEL,ALL
ESEL,S,MAT,,2
NSLE,S,ALL
PRNSOL,U,COMP
PRNSOL,S,COMP
PRNSOL,S,PRIN
/COM,Element-nodal components below preserve element boundaries.
PRESOL,S,COMP
PRESOL,EPEL,COMP
PRESOL,EPTH,COMP
/OUTPUT

/OUTPUT,TFBM_case,txt
/COM,Material 10 only. Nodal averaging is restricted to this material.
ALLSEL,ALL
ESEL,S,MAT,,10
NSLE,S,ALL
PRNSOL,U,COMP
PRNSOL,S,COMP
PRNSOL,S,PRIN
PRESOL,S,COMP
PRESOL,EPEL,COMP
PRESOL,EPTH,COMP
/OUTPUT

/OUTPUT,TFBM_cable,txt
/COM,Conductor node IDs, coordinates and applied loads for LDREAD checks.
ALLSEL,ALL
ESEL,S,MAT,,1
NSLE,S,ALL
NLIST,ALL
ELIST,ALL
FLIST,ALL
PRNSOL,U,COMP
/OUTPUT

/OUTPUT,TFBM_contacts,txt
/COM,Contact element types 12,13,14,15; target type 11 is excluded.
ALLSEL,ALL
ESEL,S,TYPE,,12,15
NSLE,S,ALL
ELIST,ALL
NLIST,ALL
PRESOL,CONT,STAT
PRESOL,CONT,PRES
PRESOL,CONT,SFRIC
PRESOL,CONT,GAP
PRESOL,CONT,SLIDE
/OUTPUT

/OUTPUT,TFBM_section_nodes,txt
/COM,Historical SCL endpoints. IDs are not stable after remeshing.
/COM,Coordinates and connectivity must be checked before reusing the path.
ALLSEL,ALL
NSEL,S,NODE,,183612
NSEL,A,NODE,,183605
NLIST,ALL
ESLN,S
ELIST,ALL
/OUTPUT

ALLSEL,ALL
CSYS,0
RSYS,0
/COM,TFBM diagnostic files written. No solution has been recomputed.
